# Fetched SEDO documents and verification output — never commit
downloads/
verified/
# Private key containers (virtual token, PKCS#12) and exported certs
Key-*.dat
*.pfx
*.p12
*.der
# Generated by release workflow (repository root only)
/release_notes.md
# IIT proprietary binaries and installers — never commit. Analyse them with
# scripts/iit_unpack.sh + scripts/iit_inventory.py; only the derived metadata
# (docs/inventory/*.json, docs/DLL-REGISTRY.md) belongs in git.
# These patterns apply at every depth, tests/ included — on purpose. Test PEs
# are built in memory (tests/test_iit_inventory.py::_tiny_pe); a binary under
# tests/fixtures/ is silently NOT added. Only a synthetic, self-made file may be
# forced in with `git add -f`; never a vendor binary.
*.dll
*.exe
*.msi
*.sys
*.cab
*.cap
*.7z

